{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15905","headline":"古从军 · 王建","name":"古从军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉家逐单于，日没处河曲。\n浮云道旁起，行子车下宿。\n枪城围鼓角，毡帐依山谷。\n马上悬壶浆，刀头分颊肉。\n来时高堂上，父母亲结束。\n回面不见家，风吹破衣服。\n金疮在肢节，相与拔箭镞。\n闻道西凉州，家家妇女哭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15905.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15905","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}